"""
OmniQ-OS: Visual Quantum Circuit Maker & Multi-Framework Compiler IDE (bin/omniq-circuit-maker)
- Interactive click-to-place multi-wire Cairo quantum circuit composer (1..8 qubits)
- Full 1Q/2Q/3Q gate palette (H, X, Y, Z, S, T, SX, RX, RY, RZ, P, CNOT, CY, CZ, SWAP, ISWAP, CP, CRZ, CCX, CSWAP, RESET, MEASURE)
- Live step-by-step time-slice scrubber updating statevector probabilities, Bloch spheres & entanglement
- Bi-directional OpenQASM 3.0 sync + Qiskit / Cirq / PennyLane code export + RFSoC microwave pulse timeline
- Direct QMMU hardware execution on /dev/accel/qpu0 & 1-click live sync to OmniQ Hilbert Space Explorer
"""

